{
  "id": "1CO.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Corinthians 12",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now concerning spiritual ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", brethren, I would not have you ignorant. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye know that when ye were Gentiles ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " led away unto those dumb idols, howsoever ye might be led. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore I make known unto you, that no man speaking in the Spirit of God saith, Jesus is anathema; and no man can say, Jesus is Lord, but in the Holy Spirit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now there are diversities of gifts, but the same Spirit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there are diversities of ministrations, and the same Lord. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there are diversities of workings, but the same God, who worketh all things in all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But to each one is given the manifestation of the Spirit to profit withal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For to one is given through the Spirit the word of wisdom; and to another the word of knowledge, according to the same Spirit: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to another faith, in the same Spirit; and to another gifts of healings, in the one Spirit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to another workings of miracles; and to another prophecy; and to another discernings of spirits: to another ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kinds of tongues; and to another the interpretation of tongues: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but all these worketh the one and the same Spirit, dividing to each one severally even as he will.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as the body is one, and hath many members, and all the members of the body, being many, are one body; so also is Christ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For in one Spirit were we all baptized into one body, whether Jews or Greeks, whether bond or free; and were all made to drink of one Spirit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the body is not one member, but many. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the foot shall say, Because I am not the hand, I am not of the body; it is not therefore not of the body. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if the ear shall say, Because I am not the eye, I am not of the body; it is not therefore not of the body. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the whole body were an eye, where were the hearing? If the whole were hearing, where were the smelling? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now hath God set the members each one of them in the body, even as it pleased him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if they were all one member, where were the body? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now they are many members, but one body. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the eye cannot say to the hand, I have no need of thee: or again the head to the feet, I have no need of you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nay, much rather, those members of the body which seem to be more feeble are necessary: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and those ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of the body, which we think to be less honorable, upon these we bestow more abundant honor; and our uncomely ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " have more abundant comeliness; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whereas our comely ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " have no need: but God tempered the body together, giving more abundant honor to that ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " which lacked; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that there should be no schism in the body; but ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the members should have the same care one for another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And whether one member suffereth, all the members suffer with it; or ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " member is honored, all the members rejoice with it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now ye are the body of Christ, and severally members thereof. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God hath set some in the church, first apostles, secondly prophets, thirdly teachers, then miracles, then gifts of healings, helps, governments, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kinds of tongues. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Are all apostles? are all prophets? are all teachers? are all ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " miracles? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "have all gifts of healings? do all speak with tongues? do all interpret? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But desire earnestly the greater gifts. And moreover a most excellent way show I unto you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
